Timeline Planner bundles the following third-party software.


Frappe Gantt
------------
The Gantt rendering in this project is built on **Frappe Gantt**, an open-source
JavaScript Gantt chart library by Frappe Technologies Pvt. Ltd. It draws the bars,
dependency arrows, timeline header, and drag/resize interactions. This project would
have been a great deal more work without it - thank you to the Frappe team and its
contributors.

  Project:  https://github.com/frappe/gantt
  Homepage: https://frappe.io/gantt
  Version:  1.2.2
  Licence:  MIT
  Files:    vendor/frappe-gantt.umd.js
            vendor/frappe-gantt.css
  Licence text: vendor/frappe-gantt.LICENSE.txt

The library is vendored rather than loaded from a CDN so that the tool makes no
network requests at all and keeps working offline. The files are unmodified copies of
the `dist` output from npm `frappe-gantt@1.2.2`.

